{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 578487, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 114498, "uid": 90022, "type": 4, "title": "水RB对抗策略", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1670775447, "updated_at": 1670903443, "updated_uid": 90022, "comment_at": 1671595771, "last_at": 1671631533, "comment_count": 55, "status": 1, "summary": "前15层：本期水rb成功的让rb回到了当年该有的难度，前面几次真的是太简单了，我新号啥都没都能随便30过。前15层能带着对策随便砍过去就不说啥了，反正那猴子也干不了你多少血。直接上个阵容图.正常练度应", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_685/h_955/1069/90022/2022/11/11/396131.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_768/h_1368/1069/90022/2022/11/11/937199.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_720/h_1280/1069/90022/2022/11/13/91985.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 7, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 16886, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "江苏省", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 10, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 578487, "content": "<div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">前15层：</span></span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">本期水rb成功的让rb回到了当年该有的难度，前面几次真的是太简单了，我新号啥都没都能随便30过。</span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">前15层能带着对策随便砍过去就不说啥了，反正那猴子也干不了你多少血。直接上个阵容图.</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">正常练度应该能给前15干过去，人偶啥的也没说法，随便打就行。</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"685\" data-height=\"955\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_685/h_955/1069/90022/2022/11/11/396131.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_685/h_955/1069/90022/2022/11/11/396131.png\" style=\"height:508.869px;width:365px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">后15层：</span></span></div>后面15层对于练度要求和宝石都有要求了属于是这期，最好是亮闪闪最后面几层可以摆烂炸过去。</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">阵容图：</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"768\" data-height=\"1368\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_768/h_1368/1069/90022/2022/11/11/937199.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_768/h_1368/1069/90022/2022/11/11/937199.png\" style=\"height:650.462px;width:365.163px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">阵容说法：</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">这边队长是给到萨拉苏</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"607\" data-height=\"53\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_607/h_53/1069/90022/2022/11/11/299498.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_607/h_53/1069/90022/2022/11/11/299498.png\" style=\"height:32px;width:366.491px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">魂卡配置上面除了萨拉苏带命中魂卡（虽然这期也没啥稳定挂上的可能），其余都带上交战就是攻击回血那个。</div><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"626\" data-height=\"332\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_626/h_332/1069/90022/2022/11/11/336004.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_626/h_332/1069/90022/2022/11/11/336004.png\" style=\"height:330px;width:622.229px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"617\" data-height=\"339\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_617/h_339/1069/90022/2022/11/11/93336.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_617/h_339/1069/90022/2022/11/11/93336.png\" style=\"height:338px;width:615.17px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">后面伤害稳定是一个问题生存也是一个问题，毕竟猴子一巴掌都是上万。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">人偶配置方面：</span></span></div><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">本阵容会用到史诗人偶一只平替我也暂时想不到。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">核心打点：给u娜挂上木奶人偶（大的小的都行u娜挂了一个ds能持续恢复1500血16s），萨拉苏带精灵人偶（还是那句话破防大概率挂不住，求稳就大刀），其余三个全部上大刀人偶。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"618\" data-height=\"396\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_618/h_396/1069/90022/2022/11/11/550906.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_618/h_396/1069/90022/2022/11/11/550906.png\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"613\" data-height=\"396\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_613/h_396/1069/90022/2022/11/11/401974.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_613/h_396/1069/90022/2022/11/11/401974.png\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"614\" data-height=\"238\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_614/h_238/1069/90022/2022/11/11/88506.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_614/h_238/1069/90022/2022/11/11/88506.png\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"619\" data-height=\"249\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_619/h_249/1069/90022/2022/11/11/629920.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_619/h_249/1069/90022/2022/11/11/629920.png\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">基本流程就是嫦娥叫猴子一个木糖猫或者u娜用木奶人偶恢复保证不掉人，基本上打出循环就能撑完一把了。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">介于可能很多人没有木奶人偶可能用这套强行回满血行不通，也可以采用下面截图的带格里拉的阵容去抵挡</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">boss摇猴子。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">阵容图：</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"720\" data-height=\"1280\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_720/h_1280/1069/90022/2022/11/13/91985.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_720/h_1280/1069/90022/2022/11/13/91985.png\" style=\"height: 745.96px; width: 419.601px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">基本上魂卡配置类的等同于上个阵容，这个阵采用带格里拉会和滑板撞buff所以给滑板下了。</div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">通关截图：</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"768\" data-height=\"1368\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_768/h_1368/1069/90022/2022/11/12/759499.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_768/h_1368/1069/90022/2022/11/12/759499.png\" style=\"height:744.463px;width:417.948px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">这号到今天是七个月零六天附魔啥的和成品还是有差距的最后几次直接摆烂炸了，最后69票收尾。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">u娜配置：</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"768\" data-height=\"1368\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_768/h_1368/1069/90022/2022/11/12/646374.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_768/h_1368/1069/90022/2022/11/12/646374.png\" style=\"height:743.763px;width:417.534px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">加成啥的全吃上大概是个130w一跳。（就是开不出新饰品我好急，防具附魔带点抗性别刀扛不住猴子一巴掌）。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">对于灭霸宝石感觉血量那个最好能亮点多加点血多加容错。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"720\" data-height=\"1280\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_720/h_1280/1069/90022/2022/11/12/459398.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_720/h_1280/1069/90022/2022/11/12/459398.png\" style=\"height:737.95px;width:415.1px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">信仰你游顶级对策吧~！</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"768\" data-height=\"1368\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_768/h_1368/1069/90022/2022/11/12/261473.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_768/h_1368/1069/90022/2022/11/12/261473.png\" style=\"height:731.463px;width:410.648px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">打完还给了两个双红攻属于是意外收获了，本攻略仅从个人观点出发，你有任何其他看点以你为准，祝大伙玩的开心，有问题可以直接来维基群询问。（rb这玩意本来就不是给萌新随便过的，前面几期真的太简单了，这次打不过也不要受挫，摆烂是解决问题的最好办法！）</div><br style=\"\"></div><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><br style=\"\"></div><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div></div><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\" style=\"\">", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_685/h_955/1069/90022/2022/11/11/396131.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_768/h_1368/1069/90022/2022/11/11/937199.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_720/h_1280/1069/90022/2022/11/13/91985.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 90022, "username": "灵车车队の墨鱼", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/17.png", "description": "灵车是门艺术", "follow_num": 19, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 2, "content_at": 114503459, "content_num": 13, "read_num": 178249, "like_num": 93}, "update_user": {"uid": 90022, "username": "灵车车队の墨鱼", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/17.png", "description": "灵车是门艺术", "follow_num": 19, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 2, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1069, "name": "天命之子韩服", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603255687217_81752678.webp?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "destinychild", "content_count": 6962, "follow_count": 16729}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": [{"uid": 90022, "username": "灵车车队の墨鱼", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/17.png", "last_ip_area": "江苏省", "last_login_device_num": 2}], "vote_list": null, "ban_image_list": null, "is_strategy": false, "is_strateg